# Scene2-2-11

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐11
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_22_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:——周一早上。<br>执行计划的日子到了。|#0202Adv11_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:醒来后，<br>我从床上下来，对艾玛打了声招呼。|#0202Adv11_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……早上好，艾玛。|#0202Adv11_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎！？啊，什么……？|#0202Adv11_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛惊讶得不知所措。<br>这也难怪。|#0202Adv11_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我们生活在一个房间里，<br>但我通常都是无视她的存在。|#0202Adv11_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:早、早上好，希罗。|#0202Adv11_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她慌张了一下，<br>但还是高兴地给我回了声早安。|#0202Adv11_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么了？那个……<br>因为很少见你跟我打招呼……|#0202Adv11_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不出所料，艾玛虽然惊讶，还是接受了我的示好。<br>我若无其事地按照脑海中编排好的计划，继续推进。|#0202Adv11_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:抱歉。之前是我太固执了。<br>但我觉得我们之间不能这样下去了。|#0202Adv11_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，我想和你聊聊以前的事。<br>如果你不介意的话……|#0202Adv11_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:当然可以呀！|#0202Adv11_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:话还没说完，艾玛就抢先答道。|#0202Adv11_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:……谢谢你。那吃完午餐后，<br>我们要不要一起去冲个澡？|#0202Adv11_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯，可以是可以……<br>但是为什么要冲澡啊？|#0202Adv11_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:因为白天应该没什么人去淋浴房。<br>我想和你两个人单独慢慢聊。<br>这样的理由不够充分？|#0202Adv11_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不会呀。<br>哎嘿嘿，感觉有点开心。|#0202Adv11_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（艾玛总是这样。<br>　露出天真无邪的笑容让人放松警惕，<br>　本性其实是个邪恶的人——）|#0202Adv11_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（不，是邪恶的魔女）|#0202Adv11_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我尽量抑制内心的想法，<br>对她露出温柔的微笑。|#0202Adv11_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那，下午2点我们在<br>淋浴房见吧。|#0202Adv11_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还有，这件事<br>是我们之间的秘密，希望你能保密。|#0202Adv11_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，为什么呢？|#0202Adv11_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我不太想被其他人<br>打探到自己的情况和过去的经历。|#0202Adv11_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这确实是我的真心话，但也是个幌子。<br>如果被其他少女得知艾玛在失踪前<br>约好和我见面，那可就麻烦了。|#0202Adv11_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……嗯，我知道了！|#0202Adv11_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ResetText

; 牢の施錠音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:到了时间，门锁开了。|#0202Adv11_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……那个，希罗。<br>要不要一起吃早饭？|#0202Adv11_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv11_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我只不过稍微主动示好了一下，<br>　就得寸进尺）|#0202Adv11_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这招我已经见过无数次了。<br>　其实她根本没受伤）|#0202Adv11_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她总是故意装作失败，或是用示弱来吸引同情，<br>　一旦自己的处境不利，就立马翻脸）|#0202Adv11_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（你就是这样<br>　对小雪见死不救的吧……！）|#0202Adv11_Hiro015|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的态度让我心生怒火，用力握紧拳头。|#0202Adv11_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……希罗，你怎么了？<br>我是不是说了什么惹你不开心的话？|#0202Adv11_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不，没什么。走吧。|#0202Adv11_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（很快就能斩断这令人恼火的根源了）|#0202Adv11_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛欢欣雀跃地走出牢房，<br>而我却跟在她身后，静静酝酿着阴暗的感情。|#0202Adv11_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

